{"message":"Thanks for the details. For security and system limitations, I can’t look up orders by email or date alone. I’ll need the exact order or case ID from your confirmation to check the status.

Please copy the ID exactly as shown (including any prefix like ORD-, SO-, CASE-, dashes, or leading zeros). If you’re unsure, check the confirmation email or invoice PDF for a line labeled “Order #” or “Order ID.”

Once I have that ID, I’ll pull up the status right away. I’ll only use it to locate your order and won’t disclose any protected data per our access policy."}

